#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:124
msgid ""
"<h1>Taskbar</h1> You can configure the taskbar here. This includes options such "
"as whether or not the taskbar should show all windows at once or only those on "
"the current desktop. You can also configure whether or not the Window List "
"button will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Taakbalk</h1> U kan die Taakbalk hier konfigureer. Hierdie sluit in opsies "
"soos hetsy of nie die Taakbalk moet alle vensters vertoon gelyktydig of slegs "
"die op die huidige werkskerm. U kan asook konfigureer hetsy of nie die Venster "
"Lys knoppie vertoon sal word."

#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:163
msgid "kcmtaskbar"
msgstr "kcmtaakbalk"

#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:163
msgid "KDE Taskbar Control Module"
msgstr "Kde Taakbalk Kontrole Module"

