#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:178 kcmtaskbar.cpp:179 kcmtaskbar.cpp:180
msgid "Cycle Through Windows"
msgstr "Wissel Deur Vensters"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 16
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Taskbar"
msgstr "Taakbalk"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 47
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show windows from all sc&reens"
msgstr "Vertoon vensters van alle skerms"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 55
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"windows which are on the same Xinerama screen as the taskbar.\n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Afdraai van hierdie opsie sal veroorsaak dat die taakbalk om te vertoon <b>"
"slegs</b> vensters wat op dieselfde Xinerama skerm is as die taakbalk.\n"
"\n"
"As standaard is hierdie opsie gekies en word alle vensters vertoon."

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 63
#: rc.cpp:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort windows by desk&top"
msgstr "Sorteer vensters deur werkskerm"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 71
#: rc.cpp:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows in order of the "
"desktop they appear on.\n"
"\n"
"By default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Kies van hierdie opsie veroorsaak dat die taakbalk om vensters te wys in opdrag "
"van die werkskerm waarop hulle verskyn.\n"
"\n"
"By verstek hierdie opsie is gekies."

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 96
#: rc.cpp:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr "Vertoon vensters van alle werkskerms"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 104
#: rc.cpp:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"the windows on the current desktop. \n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Draai hierdie opsie af sal veroorsaak dat die taakbalk vertoon <b>slegs</b> "
"die vensters van die huidige werkskerm. \n"
"\n"
"By verstek, hierdie opsie is gekies en alle vensters word vertoon."

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 120
#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Group similar tasks:"
msgstr "Groepeer soortgelyke take:"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 143
#: rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The taskbar can group similar windows into single buttons. When one of these "
"window group buttons are clicked on a menu appears showing all the windows in "
"that group. This can be especially useful with the <em>Show all windows</em> "
"option.\n"
"\n"
"You can set the taskbar to <strong>Never</strong> group windows, to <strong>"
"Always</strong> group windows or to group windows only <strong>"
"When the Taskbar is Full</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"By default the taskbar groups windows when it is full."
msgstr ""
"Die taakbalk kan soortgelyke vensters in enkele knoppies groepeer. As een van "
"hierdie venster groep knoppies aangekliek word, verskyn 'n keislys met al die "
"vensters in daardie groep. Dit kan veral nuttig wees met die <em>"
"Wys alle vensters</em> opsies.\n"
"\n"
"U kan die taakbalk instel na <sterk>Nooit</sterk> groep vensters, na <sterk>"
"Altyd</sterk> groep vensters of na groep vensters slegs <sterk>"
"Wanneer die Taakbalk vol is Vol</sterk>.\n"
"\n"
"By verstek die taakbalk groepeer vensters wanneer dit vol is."

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 153
#: rc.cpp:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sho&w application icons"
msgstr "Vertoon aansoek ikoone"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 161
#: rc.cpp:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want window icons to appear along with their titles "
"in the taskbar.\n"
"\n"
"By default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie as jy venster ikone wil laat verskyn saam met hulle titels "
"in die taakbalk.\n"
"\n"
"By verstek word hierdie opsie gekies."

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 169
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show window list &button"
msgstr "Vertoon venster lys knoppie"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 175
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to display a button that, when "
"clicked, shows a list of all windows in a popup menu."
msgstr ""
"Die kies van hier die opsie veroorsaak die taakbalk om 'n knoppie te vertoon "
"wat, wanneer gekliek, wys 'n lys van alle vensters in 'n opspring kieslys."

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 183
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show o&nly minimized windows"
msgstr "Vertoon slegs minimeerde vensters"

#. i18n: file kcmtaskbarui.ui line 188
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"minimized windows. \n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is not selected and the taskbar will show all windows."
msgstr ""
"Kies van hierdie opsie as u wil hê die taakbalk moet vertoon <b>slegs</b> "
"minimeer vensters. \n"
"\n"
"Deur verstek, word hierdie opsie nie gekies nie en die taakbalk sal alle "
"vensters vertoon."

